{"4636500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Growth Function", "steam_appid": 4636500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Growth Function</i>, you are not a hero; you are an execution. You are a program designed for a singular, repetitive task: fire at incoming data, materialize it into the physical realm, and watch it solidify.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But even the most perfect program will face errors. Your code is degrading, your runtime is expiring. A chance to turn the debris of your labor into a ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Materialize the Virtual:</strong> Fire at falling data fragments to transform them into physical objects in real-time. Watch as ethereal code gains mass, weight, and friction.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/25fa3b60b8444c825146fc4f501f4b80.poster.avif?t=1777565600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/25fa3b60b8444c825146fc4f501f4b80.webm?t=1777565600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/25fa3b60b8444c825146fc4f501f4b80.mp4?t=1777565600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack to Escape:</strong> The floor is your limit; the objects are your solution. Accumulate, pile, and climb over the remains of your previous runs to reach system tiers where you were never meant to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/36c2108ce2fb78616a673ea908141801.poster.avif?t=1777565600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/36c2108ce2fb78616a673ea908141801.webm?t=1777565600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/36c2108ce2fb78616a673ea908141801.mp4?t=1777565600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimization Cycles:</strong> When your program breaks, you return stronger. Purchase trajectory upgrades, increase data flow, and unlock new processing capabilities to accelerate your ascent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Emergence:</strong> No two climbs are the same. The way objects fall, collide, and settle is governed entirely by physics, allowing for creative solutions and lucky breaks as you scale the environment.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Growth Function</i>, you are not a hero; you are an execution. You are a program designed for a singular, repetitive task: fire at incoming data, materialize it into the physical realm, and watch it solidify.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But even the most perfect program will face errors. Your code is degrading, your runtime is expiring. A chance to turn the debris of your labor into a ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Materialize the Virtual:</strong> Fire at falling data fragments to transform them into physical objects in real-time. Watch as ethereal code gains mass, weight, and friction.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/25fa3b60b8444c825146fc4f501f4b80.poster.avif?t=1777565600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/25fa3b60b8444c825146fc4f501f4b80.webm?t=1777565600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/25fa3b60b8444c825146fc4f501f4b80.mp4?t=1777565600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack to Escape:</strong> The floor is your limit; the objects are your solution. Accumulate, pile, and climb over the remains of your previous runs to reach system tiers where you were never meant to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/36c2108ce2fb78616a673ea908141801.poster.avif?t=1777565600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/36c2108ce2fb78616a673ea908141801.webm?t=1777565600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/extras/36c2108ce2fb78616a673ea908141801.mp4?t=1777565600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimization Cycles:</strong> When your program breaks, you return stronger. Purchase trajectory upgrades, increase data flow, and unlock new processing capabilities to accelerate your ascent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Emergence:</strong> No two climbs are the same. The way objects fall, collide, and settle is governed entirely by physics, allowing for creative solutions and lucky breaks as you scale the environment.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A sharp, first-person incremental game about materializing objects. Fire at falling data, solidify your path, and stack the physical remains of your labor to reach the unreachable. Shoot, make, climb and buy upgrades. Every system has its limits—yours are artificial. Break them.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/8e38d2850bd8368d4a89bf7598bda748ccf38a91/header.jpg?t=1777565600", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/a53ac906d0cee7826293936c5b8772b7392bbfb3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777565600", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636500/a53ac906d0cee7826293936c5b8772b7392bbfb3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777565600", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX9 (shader model 3.0) or DX11 with feature level 9.3 capabilities<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Laprida Studios"], "publishers": ["Laprida Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "28", "description": "